# AuraSpace Frontend Build Environment Configuration
# Copy to `frontend/.env.local` for local standalone Vite builds, or pass as
# `VITE_API_URL` build arg when building `frontend/Dockerfile`.

# Base URL for FastAPI backend calls:
# - `/api` when served behind Nginx reverse proxy (`frontend/nginx.conf` + `docker-compose.yml`)
# - `http://127.0.0.1:8000` for local Vite dev server against local FastAPI
# - Leave empty only if running in offline Demo Sandbox mode
VITE_API_URL=/api
